{"availability":"available","full":"ArmanTheFirst/omznchat","name":"omznchat","description":"redefining chat with agent-driven communication. like cars went from manual driving to self-driving, we're pioneering the shift from manual messaging to autonomous, ai-powered conversations. Join the discord: https://discord.gg/wnAW2AjJhm","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":6,"forks":0,"created":"2025-02-14T20:10:59Z","updated":"2025-12-06T09:57:13Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://omznchat.vercel.app","topics":["agents","ai","chat","future","privacy","pwa"],"demo":"https://omznchat.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T23:18:16.219Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T23:18:16.219Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T23:18:16.219Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:58:44.264Z","stars":6,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T23:18:16.219Z","stars":6,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Think about cars. For over a century, we've been manually driving—hands on the wheel, eyes on the road, navigating every turn ourselves. But now, the vision of self-driving cars is becoming reality, promising to fundamentally transform transportation by handling the driving for us while we focus on what truly matters.","Chat is at that same inflection point. Today, we're still \"manually driving\" our conversations—typing every message, managing every thread, remembering every follow-up. But we envision a future where intelligent agents can handle communication on our behalf, allowing us to focus on the essential human connections and creative work that truly require our attention. omznchat is built with this ambitious vision at its core: to completely redefine the chat experience and pioneer the transition from manual messaging to agent-assisted communication.","⚠️ IMPORTANT DEVELOPMENT NOTICE This project is currently in early active development and is NOT production-ready. Features are incomplete, APIs may change without notice, and significant bugs are expected. Use at your own risk. When we switch to production, our third party providers (Clerk, Stream) may erase existing user data."],"features":["💬 Real-time chat that just works — snappy messages, nothing lost in space","🔒 Simple, safe sign-in — use your favorite account, no password headaches","🛎️ Optional notifications — browser or PWA push, no pressure, zero spam","🧭 Unified dashboard mockup — all chats and settings on one clean dashboard route","🕵️‍♂️ Incognito chat — participate anonymously in direct/group conversations"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArmanTheFirst/omznchat/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"decd4f3fefd4416971015cf1daad591a7c80a0384cb45ee3cb170a054c1f77f8","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:44.392Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T13:58:44.392Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Think about cars. For over a century, we've been manually driving—hands on the wheel, eyes on the road, navigating every turn ourselves. But now, the vision of self-driving cars is becoming reality, promising to fundamentally transform transportation by handling the driving for us while we focus on what truly matters.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArmanTheFirst/omznchat/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"🔒 Simple, safe sign-in — use your favorite account, no password headaches","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArmanTheFirst/omznchat/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"To test and develop omznchat locally, you need API keys/accounts for:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArmanTheFirst/omznchat/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"To test and develop omznchat locally, you need API keys/accounts for:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArmanTheFirst/omznchat/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"decd4f3fefd4416971015cf1daad591a7c80a0384cb45ee3cb170a054